{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2415000/extras/855a8622ec6e62c183935b97578ea7b1.poster.avif?t=1768295316\" width=540 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2415000/extras/855a8622ec6e62c183935b97578ea7b1.webm?t=1768295316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blackout</strong> is a hardcore co-op shooter set in the Earth Federation, now overrun by special infected creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From secret laboratories to deep underground high-speed subway stations, you are deployed as near-future special forces to key Federation facilities. <br>Leave no infected behind\u2014eliminate them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4-Player Co-op Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2415000/extras/29bc7b6d693765da434bf2529105506f.poster.avif?t=1768295316\" width=800 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2415000/extras/29bc7b6d693765da434bf2529105506f.webm?t=1768295316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One mistake can mean total annihilation. Teamwork is the only solution. Form a squad of 1 to 4 players and sweep through zones controlled by the infected.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous high-risk operations await you and your team. Complete every mission across a vast range of objectives. Unlock sealed routes and enter hidden, uncontrollable areas.  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Varied Combat Zones and Tactical Operations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2415000/extras/fcd4d933765d05f686b33b7176eb3c89.poster.avif?t=1768295316\" width=800 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2415000/extras/fcd4d933765d05f686b33b7176eb3c89.webm?t=1768295316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2415000/extras/fcd4d933765d05f686b33b7176eb3c89.mp4?t=1768295316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How you handle your weapon will determine your squad\u2019s survival. Choose from a variety of weapons suited to the situation and take control of each zone in your own way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to shifting patterns of infection and dynamic environments. Use a wide array of tactical gear to break through unpredictable threats head-on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2415000/extras/5685f8e7d4399bca7966c32eb06ffec4.poster.avif?t=1768295316\" width=800 height=399 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2415000/extras/5685f8e7d4399bca7966c32eb06ffec4.webm?t=1768295316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2415000?t=1768295316","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2415000?t=1768295316","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s